# ── Secrets & Environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# READ THIS BEFORE EDITING. On 20 Sep the six-hourly code backup (`git add -A` → push to
# GitHub) was found trying to commit SEVEN `biz.env.bak.*` files — live SMTP passwords, API
# keys, the JWT secret, the backup passphrase — plus nine full server tarballs and the
# encrypted DB backup repo. It had been failing for days, and the ONLY reason nothing reached
# GitHub is that one of those .bak files happened to be root-owned, so `git add` aborted with
# "Permission denied" before it finished.
#
# In other words a BUG was the only thing protecting the secrets, and the obvious "fix" —
# chown the file so the backup works — would have published them on the next run.
#
# `biz.env` matched the literal name and `*.env` matched files ENDING in .env. Neither
# matches `biz.env.bak.1785960845`. Patterns here are now prefix-based for that reason: match
# anything that STARTS with a secret's name, not just its exact spelling.
biz.env*
*.env
.env
*.env.local
wa_env_append.txt
*.bak
*.bak.*

# Backups are large, private, and belong off-site — never in the code repo. The daily tarballs
# are ~500MB each, which is also what grew the abandoned temp packs that ate 30GB of disk.
backups/
db-backup-repo/

# Credential stores that live in the app directory.
.gnupg/
.gitconfig
*.kbx

# ── Database ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── SSH Keys & Certificates ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
gdrive_tokens/

# ── Generated / Runtime Outputs ───────────────────────────────────────────────
generated_pdfs/
generated_videos/
uploads/
apk/                          # 96MB of WhatsApp APK builds — back up separately (releases / cloud storage)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
*.egg

# ── Virtual Environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Logs & Temp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.log.*
_*.py
_*.txt
_*.json
_*.sql
_*.sh

# ── IDE & OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Test Artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
test_output*.txt
test_results*.txt
test_run*.txt
test_final*.txt
prelaunch_output*.txt
prelaunch_results*.txt
prelaunch_run*.txt

# runtime deploy trigger (watched by sarathi-deploy.path)
.deploy-trigger

# Doc Splitter working job files (shared across workers, runtime only)
var/

# ── UI flow tests (Playwright browsers are ~300MB; never committed) ───────────
node_modules/
uitest/node_modules/
uitest/.playwright/
uitest/screenshots/
